Runes</a> to cut off the area in case you get swarmed. If not, prepare to have to fight up to 20 creatures in a row before you can catch your breath. Also Hatebreeder, one of the Ghastly Dragon bosses, appears here.\n</p><p>To get access to this area, you must complete the <a href=\"#/quest/wrath-of-the-emperor-quest\">Wrath of the Emperor Quest</a> up until the tenth mission. Because of this, the area is sometimes informally referred to as \"Mission 10\".\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Creatures in the main area</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Draken%20Abomination\"><img alt=\"Draken Abomination\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"53\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Draken_Abomination_b5afba.gif\" width=\"58\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Draken%20Abomination\">Draken Abomination</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">4,500</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">6,250</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">1200</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>1-199× <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a> (common)</li>\n<li>1-4× <a href=\"#/wiki/Meat\">Meat</a> (common)</li>\n<li>1-8× <a href=\"#/wiki/Platinum%20Coin\">Platinum Coin</a> (common)</li>\n<li>Eye of Corruption (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Scale%20of%20Corruption\">Scale of Corruption</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>1-3× <a href=\"#/wiki/Ultimate%20Health%20Potion\">Ultimate H